      "id": "semanticscholar:d9a69d44841044a12bc72df848cd94b78524ed84",
      "title": "Time-VLM: Exploring Multimodal Vision-Language Models for Augmented Time Series Forecasting",
      "url": "https://www.semanticscholar.org/paper/d9a69d44841044a12bc72df848cd94b78524ed84",
